<p>You draw electical potential energy from your surroundings to replenish your Psi.</p><p>This deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100,<br>psi 50%">77, 104, 125, 142, 158</acronym> (max <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">116, 156, 187, 214, 237</acronym>) Lightning damage to all targets around you within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3,</acronym> and has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>psi 50%">21%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 45%</acronym> (max <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">26%, 36%, 43%, 48%, 52%</acronym>) chance to daze them for 3 turns.</p><p>You replenish <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>psi 50%">10, 13, 15, 18, 20</acronym> (max <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15, 20, 23, 27, 30</acronym>) Psi from the first target, with each additional target restoring 20% less than the one before it.</p><p>The strength of these effects increases as your Psi depletes and with your Mindpower.</p>